{"id":9055696,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-cv/merge_requests/1335","number":1335,"state":"merged","title":"fix(image_projective_transform): support unknown shape inference","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-cv/pulls/1335","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-cv/pulls/1335/issues","body":"## 描述\n\n修复 ImageProjectiveTransform InferShape 对动态 shape/rank 的处理，并补齐对应 UT：\n\n- 支持 `images`、`transforms`、`output_shape` 的 unknown rank，输出为 unknown rank。\n- unknown rank 不再跳过其他已知输入仍可执行的 rank、维度合法性校验。\n- 支持 `transforms` 尾维为 `UNKNOWN_DIM` 及动态 batch；已知非法维度仍返回失败。\n- `output_shape` 已知长度严格校验为 2；非常量数据推导为 `{N, -1, -1, C}`；常量中的 0 维按空维保留。\n- 将 ascend950 的 5 个 tiling UT 移至 `op_host/arch35` 并注册到 tiling 测试模块，避免用例未实际执行。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n\n无。\n\n## 测试\n\n- ascend950 `cv_op_host_ut` 构建通过。\n- `ImageProjectiveTransformTiling.*`：5/5 通过。\n- `ImageProjectiveTransformInfershape.*`：12/12 通过。\n- 对全部 4 个变更文件执行 `pre-commit run --files ...`，所有检查通过（含 clang-format、codespell、OAT）。\n\n## 文档更新\n\n无；现有 README 已定义 `output_shape` 为 2 个元素且 0 表示空维。\n\n## 类型标签\n\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [x] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [x] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：","assignees_number":10,"assignees":[{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68ad1e460f9a7255ef7a79e1","login":"pingchuantang","name":"TangPC","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/cc/cb/54c196c65c928b997e66a9d6e53d357e4a5c63e61d32874f3d3a5953d364de62.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/pingchuantang","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"682accc0a6508e17e040cd22","login":"zhangzijie","name":"zhangzijie","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangzijie","assignee":true,"code_owner":f